:: MP Night Event Alley 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "commercial">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>午夜的商业区小巷只有尽头一盏煤气灯闪着微光，两只野猫在翻倒的木箱间追逐，撞落了一只挂在消防梯下的防水布包。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回商业区 (0:02)|Commercial Alleyways]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpNightEv_alley_1 is 1>>
这处暗格今天已经仔细查验过，眼下并无新的动静。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续深入 (0:04)|MP Night Event Alley 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-night-event-alley-1">
<<sneakicon>><<link "踩木箱勾下防水包 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-night-event-alley-1">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpNightEv_alley_1 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("night_ev_alley_1")>><<money 280>><</if>>你轻巧勾下布包，里面装着夜班跑腿留下的零钱与一张后巷近道草图。<span class="green">你在夜巷消防梯下有所斩获。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续前行 (0:04)|MP Night Event Alley 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	木箱板条松动晃了一下，你的手肘擦在砖墙上。<span class="red">砖墙擦红了你的小臂。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Night Event Alley 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Commercial Alleyways]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "挑落布包 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-night-event-alley-1">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpNightEv_alley_1 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("night_ev_alley_1_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>布包稳稳落进怀里，没有发出半点声响，你顺手收起了里面的零钞。<span class="green">你悄无声息地取下了夜巷布包。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[去商业区 (0:04)|Commercial Alleyways]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	竹竿头滑了一下，布包掉进浅水洼溅起几点泥星。<span class="red">你擦净布包退回干处。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Night Event Alley 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回商业区 (0:03)|Commercial Alleyways]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Night Event Alley 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "commercial">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>顺着后巷往里走，裁缝铺后门的换气百叶窗下透出微弱暖光，门廊石阶边遗落着一只镶银顶针盒。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回商业区 (0:03)|Commercial Alleyways]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpNightEv_alley_2 is 1>>
今日的事宜已料理妥当，无需在此处重复费神。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续深入 (0:04)|MP Night Event Alley 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-night-event-alley-2">
<<mptailoricon>><<link "拾顶针盒塞入窗缝 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-night-event-alley-2">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpNightEv_alley_2 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("night_ev_alley_2")>><<money 320>><</if>>窗内守夜学徒感激地推开小窗，递给你几枚银币作为拾遗谢礼。<span class="green">你的善举换来了夜班学徒的酬谢。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续前行 (0:04)|MP Night Event Alley 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	百叶窗合页生锈，塞入顶针盒时刮痛了指节。<span class="red">你缩回手退入暗影。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Night Event Alley 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Commercial Alleyways]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "轻叩顶针盒 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-night-event-alley-2">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpNightEv_alley_2 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("night_ev_alley_2_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>守夜学徒闻声开窗取走顶针盒，笑着塞给你一包夜班老字号信物铜牌。<span class="green">你礼貌提醒学徒归还了顶针盒。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[去商业区 (0:04)|Commercial Alleyways]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	巷口风声盖过了叩窗声，里面一时无人应答。<span class="red">你等风声小些再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Night Event Alley 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回商业区 (0:03)|Commercial Alleyways]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Night Event Docks 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>深夜两点的旧港栈桥海雾弥漫，守夜巡逻艇的探照灯每隔半分钟扫过三号泊位，系船桩下卡着一只随潮漂来的密封朗姆酒匣。
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回旧港 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpNightEv_docks_1 is 1>>
周围一切平静如常，今天不必再往里翻检了。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续深入 (0:04)|MP Night Event Docks 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) lt 100>>
<div id="act-mp-night-event-docks-1">
<<mpdrinkicon>><<link "捞起酒匣 (0:06)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-night-event-docks-1">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpNightEv_docks_1 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("night_ev_docks_1")>><<money 280>><</if>>你在光束扫回前将酒匣提上干燥栈桥，匣内除了好酒还夹着几枚防水银币。<span class="green">你避开夜巡灯光捞起了漂流酒匣。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续前行 (0:04)|MP Night Event Docks 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	浪花突然拍上石阶，冰凉海水打湿了你的鞋袜。<span class="red">海风吹得湿脚踝阵阵发凉。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Night Event Docks 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "夜巡光束下的水声">>
<br>
<<link "拖回酒匣 (0:07)">><<mpalert 6>><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-night-event-docks-1">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpNightEv_docks_1 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("night_ev_docks_1_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>铁钩稳稳勾住木匣提手，你站在背光处不湿寸缕便将酒匣收入囊中。<span class="green">你巧用副缆在暗处收妥了酒匣。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[去旧港 (0:04)|Docks]]>><<pass 4>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<<else>>
	副缆上沾满湿滑海藻，拉拽时磨红了掌心。<span class="red">你拍去手上湿藻退后半步。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Night Event Docks 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回旧港 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "副缆绞盘的响动">>
</div>
<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) gte 80>>
<br>
<div id="mp-alert-docks-1-exit">
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) gte 100>>
<<if ($physique or 0) gte 280 or ($combat or 0) gte 260>><<link [[拼死一搏 (0:12)|MP Elite Encounter Abyssal Tentacles]]>><<set $mpReturnPassage to "Docks">><<set $mpAlert to 0>><<set $mpAlertCaught to 0>><<pass 12>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">拼死一搏 (0:12)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260>><<link [[虚张声势 (0:08)|MP Alert Docks Bluff]]>><<set $mpReturnPassage to "Docks">><<set $mpAlertReturn to "MP Night Event Docks 1">><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">虚张声势 (0:08)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260>><<link [[转身就跑 (0:06)|MP Alert Docks Flee]]>><<set $mpReturnPassage to "Docks">><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">转身就跑 (0:06)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
<<link [[硬闯出去 (0:10)|MP Elite Encounter Abyssal Tentacles]]>><<set $mpReturnPassage to "Docks">><<set $mpAlert to 0>><<set $mpAlertCaught to 0>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<</if>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Night Event Docks 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>栈桥尽头的夜航信号灯油壶快要见底，灯芯火苗在夜风里忽明忽暗，值班老水手正四处找备用油罐。
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回旧港 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpNightEv_docks_2 is 1>>
你今天已经把这里的首尾收拾干净，先回前头歇息吧。
