	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续前行 (0:04)|MP Night Event Docks 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	备用鲸油罐沉重冰凉，拎起时磕到了脚踝。<span class="red">你扶住锚链箱稳住身形。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Night Event Docks 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "灯油与铁皮罐的响动">>
<br>
<<link "并合余油 (0:07)">><<mpalert 4>><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-night-event-docks-2">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpNightEv_docks_2 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("night_ev_docks_2_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>油位升起后灯火顿时明亮如昼，老水手欣慰地付了你帮工钱。<span class="green">你巧用余油保住了夜航信号灯。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[去旧港 (0:04)|Docks]]>><<pass 4>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<<else>>
	船栈摇晃让漏斗歪斜，两滴鲸油洒在石板上。<span class="red">你扶正漏斗继续注油。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Night Event Docks 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回旧港 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "灯油与铁皮罐的响动">>
</div>
<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) gte 80>>
