:: MP Night Event Forest 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>子夜的密林深处月影斑驳，一丛发光的夜光蕈下压着半截猎人遗落的黄铜望远镜筒，周围树冠传来夜枭的低鸣。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回森林 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpNightEv_forest_1 is 1>>
此处今日已经走过一遭，趁天色尚早去别处转转吧。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续深入 (0:04)|MP Night Event Forest 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-night-event-forest-1">
<<mpastroicon>><<link "拨蕨叶取出望远镜 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-night-event-forest-1">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpNightEv_forest_1 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("night_ev_forest_1")>><<money 280>><</if>>镜筒内胆干燥完好，旋开后盖还藏着几枚猎人留下的应急银币。<span class="green">你在夜光蕈丛下寻获了完好镜筒。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续前行 (0:04)|MP Night Event Forest 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	夜露打湿了衣袖，蕨丛下的荆棘刺了一下手背。<span class="red">你缩回手甩去露水。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Night Event Forest 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "探清捕兽夹 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-night-event-forest-1">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set $daily.mpNightEv_forest_1 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("night_ev_forest_1_keepsake")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span><</if>>你挑开一处松脱的细铜丝猎套，安全取出了黄铜镜筒与里面的存银。<span class="green">你的谨慎让你避开暗套拿到镜筒。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[去森林 (0:04)|Forest]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	夜枭突然振翅掠过头顶，吓得你脚下一滑踩进软泥。<span class="red">靴底沾上了一层湿黑林泥。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Night Event Forest 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回森林 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Night Event Forest 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>林间溪谷的独木桥在夜雾中泛着湿光，桥头石桩的防风灯罩里卡着一封守林人留给路人的路标信。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回森林 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpNightEv_forest_2 is 1>>
桌案与器物都已归置妥帖，今天不用再忙活这一摊了。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续深入 (0:04)|MP Night Event Forest 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-night-event-forest-2">
