	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Night Event Orphanage 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "拢火苗再披毯 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-night-event-orphanage-2">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpNightEv_orphanage_2 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("night_ev_orphanage_2_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>灯光变得柔和温暖，大孩子醒来后感激地把零花纪念铜扣塞给你。<span class="green">你温柔照拂了夜读睡着的同伴。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[去孤儿院 (0:04)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	薄毯边角勾到了桌上的铅笔盒，发出一声轻响。<span class="red">你按住铅笔盒免得吵醒他。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Night Event Orphanage 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回孤儿院 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
